.TH OPEN-NDI-MONITOR "1" "April 2026" "open-ndi-monitor 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
open-ndi-monitor \- fullscreen NDI video receiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B open-ndi-monitor
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBopen-ndi-monitor\fR displays NDI video sources fullscreen on a monitor.
.PP
It automatically discovers NDI sources on the network and presents a CLI
selector if multiple sources are available.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fIPATH\fR
Path to configuration file (default: ndi-monitor.conf)
.SH CONFIGURATION
Config file is INI format with keys:
.TP
\fBsource_name\fR
NDI source to connect to (empty = first available)
.TP
\fBfullscreen\fR
true or false (default: true)
.TP
\fBdisplay_index\fR
Which monitor to use (default: 0)
.SH AUTHOR
Written by micah.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/anomalyco/open-ndi-monitor